{'symbol': 'IPG', 'date': '2022-07-12 12:00:00', 'title': 'NOT SURPRISED, NOT DELIGHTED: ONLY A THIRD OF CUSTOMERS ARE HAPPY WITH THEIR BRAND RELATIONSHIPS', 'text': 'R/GA\'S LATEST RESEARCH REPORT UNCOVERS THE SIX BRAND ATTRIBUTES THAT OUTWEIGH "SURPRISE AND DELIGHT" IN KEEPING CUSTOMERS SATISFIED NEW YORK , JULY 12, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- PUBLISHED TODAY, R/GA\'S LATEST BRAND RELATIONSHIP DESIGN REPORT SHOWS THAT DESPITE MARKETERS\' SHIFT TO A FOCUS ON RETENTION, JUST OVER A THIRD (35%) OF CUSTOMERS ARE COMPLETELY SATISFIED WITH THEIR BRAND RELATIONSHIPS. 70% OF ATTRIBUTES THAT CONTRIBUTE TO CUSTOMER SATISFACTION ARE LINKED TO CUSTOMER CONFIDENCE.'}